  <item>
    <title>41.与连三球闲聊：从没听过的身体观</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab1db4593d5eb3bdc790012</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ab1db4593d5eb3bdc790012</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>天天在短视频上刷连三球老师，他能把“杂乱的知识”混到一起，听起来简单轻松。连老师不仅能做知识的“心灵按摩”，还能做身体按摩。这期从按摩开始聊——换个视角看我们的身体，也聊连老师学习与分享知识的发心。</span></p><p><span>收听愉快。</span></p><p><span>本期内容包括：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="67">01:07</a> 没有窟窿的按摩床</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a> 新视角看身体：红肌与白肌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 为琢磨一本书，学习了“一切”知识</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="772">12:52</a> 连老师从前下煤矿的“一维生活”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1124">18:44</a> 身心一体or身心二元</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1634">27:14</a> 身体的「应和」与「附和」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1795">29:55</a> 丹田究竟是什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2097">34:57</a> 无耻，真是耻骨没有感觉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2344">39:04</a> “人有天赋差异，但不超过两倍”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2563">42:43</a> 肌肉的做功、维持与欲望</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3040">50:40</a> 身体的调节最后会反映到心力上</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3420">57:00</a> 翻正功能是我们的“亲爹”</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65bb55f6513a776b57dedb32/lr1PA1ezpvQpzrBvfVbo6dRh8H7b.m4a" length="60562948" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:02:21</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk_fWvwF0GQU9_tvdC_xm9FGUYtH.png"/>
