  <item>
    <title>38.与川糖周掌门闲聊：茅台！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a31280d43a22a695584c7ac</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a31280d43a22a695584c7ac</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>以前觉得喝茅台是上一代人的事情，现在我也喝起了茅台，酒桌上朋友们老问我一些关于茅台的问题，我解答的同时也产生了一些困惑。本期嘉宾：茅台的资深经销商川糖周掌门，以后再有人问我，我就甩播客链接。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;收听愉快。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;本期内容包括：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> “川糖周掌门”听起来是门派</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="263">04:23</a> 学经济学怎么会干白酒？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="368">06:08</a> 酒类经销商的来源</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="621">10:21</a> 茅台是如何成为No.1的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="884">14:44</a> 十年前就有的说法——年轻人不喝茅台？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1066">17:46</a> 王建国真省钱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1327">22:07</a> "储足陈酿，不卖新酒"</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">32:30</a> 喝老酒是和时间的对话</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2194">36:34</a>都是酱酒差在哪？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2483">41:23</a> 反直觉：内蒙爱喝低度酒？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2828">47:08</a> 茅台的本质是一种农产品</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3383">56:23</a> "堰塞湖"看的是结果，周掌门看的是过程</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3503">58:23</a> 喝到假酒的小故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3843">01:04:03</a> 经销商的生意还能做多久？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">01:05:00</a> 爱茅台买一瓶三天才到，我今天就能让你喝到</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4347">01:12:27</a> 茅台最大的护城河</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4683">01:18:03</a> 总结茅台：除了贵没什么缺点</span></p><p><span>本期播客所有分享均来自公开信息，不构成任何投资建议。股市有风险，投资需谨慎，投资者应独立决策并自行承担风险。</span></p>]]></description>
