  <item>
    <title>37.和半拿铁闲聊：一不小心就开始回忆</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69eb22241d989496e768a393</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69eb22241d989496e768a393</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《半拿铁｜商业沉浮录》是我平时听得最多的播客，终于找到机会和刘飞、潇磊线下聊一聊，收获了很多新的思考。用嘴“思考”这个过程太开心了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容包括：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="29">00:29</a> 潇磊原来跟伟大爷是同行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="174">02:54</a> 刘飞在大厂做产品的10年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 半拿铁的起点：商业与故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> 李诞入坑之作：《中国饮料故事》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="743">12:23</a> 中文播客的潮流与变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="924">15:24</a> 学到了！不易散伙的工作模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> 播客的商业化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1663">27:43</a> 推荐一个远古电台节目：《信不信由你》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> 让声音有亲切度，像老朋友一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2263">37:43</a> 设计好的表达就不是真诚的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2626">43:46</a> 播客与公众身份带来的朋友们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">46:30</a> 许巍老师，呼兰想认识你！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3040">50:40</a> 播客是一个“赋魅”的过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3330">55:30</a> AI是已有知识最好的老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3669">01:01:09</a> 人与 AI 合作的不可替代性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4005">01:06:45</a> “我们真是最后一代古代人，又是最新一代的现代人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4194">01:09:54</a> 我们如数家珍的互联网故事</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65bb55f6513a776b57dedb32/luNH8CAHsj7pjBTWaIEUTOkWoS6a.m4a" length="75949474" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:11</itunes:duration>
