  <item>
    <title>36.李诞×陈嘉映：“我擅长理解伟大心灵”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69afca292a2882aae747aadc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69afca292a2882aae747aadc</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Mar 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>终于来了！多次阅读，多次引用的陈嘉映老师。这回我好像终于懂了一点儿“象”这个概念，也聊到了我们播客一直很关心的善良，真理以及心灵。收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容包括：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> 在北大“哲漂”的民哲们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="411">06:51</a> 陈嘉映也是民哲？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">09:43</a> 哲学生们毕业后何去何从</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="826">13:46</a> AI时代需要新的哲学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="987">16:27</a> 何为「认知」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 科学取消了哲学的讨论资格吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1453">24:13</a> 万能面试题：近大远小</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1874">31:14</a> 善良可以千人千面吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 红色在哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2164">36:04</a> 世界除了“作用”还有“呈现”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2197">36:37</a> 何为「象」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3015">50:15</a> 真理恰恰在谈话里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3190">53:10</a> 我知道什么是正当的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3304">55:04</a> 谈《红楼梦》与维特根斯坦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4042">01:07:22</a> 我关心人的心灵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4431">01:13:51</a>你要打壁球还打网球</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4679">01:17:59</a> “我们从开端处出发，并且始终守在开端处。”</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65bb55f6513a776b57dedb32/lhgW6lKq1OGkws3yg0xWhLxjQ5bn.m4a" length="76292803" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk_fWvwF0GQU9_tvdC_xm9FGUYtH.png"/>
