  <item>
    <title>35.鉴定网络热门生物：无穷小亮！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/697b4975b4be4c149b24a741</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">697b4975b4be4c149b24a741</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>跟无穷小亮网友多年，他创作了广大科学爱好者和纯闲着没事儿的人都喜闻乐见的《网络热门生物鉴定》系列，担任《博物》杂志副主编，还衍生出“戴胜之父”、“水猴子之父”、“狐主任”等称呼。小亮做科普的十几年遇到了太多有意思的事，分享给各位，收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><p><span>温馨提示：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2318">38:38</a>～<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2762">46:02</a> 怕虫的朋友们慎听</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容包括：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="118">01:58</a> 十年前网友每天都在向小亮“请教”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="301">05:01</a> 《博物》每年的订阅量居然还在增长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="441">07:21</a> 再次推荐《海错图笔记》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="866">14:26</a> 内蒙粉红的湖和雷暴“龙”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1169">19:29</a> 亲近自然好去处：川西、瑞士、西双版纳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1371">22:51</a> 做科普，别陷入知识诅咒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1457">24:17</a> 十头熊跳蹦床和“天青色瞪眼鱼”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 找准一个兴趣领域，变成专家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2282">38:02</a> 野生燕窝的产地太“地狱”了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2770">46:10</a> 人都会面临的舆论压力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3135">52:15</a> 狐主任的自媒体经验分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3362">56:02</a> 科普账号推荐：毕导、老郭美食、漫士沉思录、火柴人AlanBecker、芳斯塔芙、小阳的昆虫世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3743">01:02:23</a> 床虱？蟑螂？弄死！</span></p><span></span><p><span>朋友们，之后一年《李诞》的播客音频版就在小宇宙上放啦，感谢收听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期点赞前六的评论（截至发布一周后），赠送无穷小亮的文创周边一份，感谢小亮！</span></p><span></span><p><span>小亮推荐的、容易养的植物：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrSb6AGK07_aoatLQOOJ--OsbbCI.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>阴天也能养好的多肉：瓦苇</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsWDrp_jphm2f_QTFQpWaUAlb6RH.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>弱光也能开花：非洲堇、迷你岩桐、堇兰</span></p><span></span><p><span>（仅做分享，图片来源网络）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65bb55f6513a776b57dedb32/lsFcWzEkgwOvkrKiEqcPDmrrSo5H.m4a" length="64256765" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:09</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk_fWvwF0GQU9_tvdC_xm9FGUYtH.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>35</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>34.小浣熊水浒卡的作者们！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/695fc43c8f388c61e1e30662</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">695fc43c8f388c61e1e30662</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 08 Jan 2026 16:00:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>小时候为小浣熊水浒卡痴狂过，从那之后就再也没有想把一个东西集齐的渴望了。有幸联系上了水浒卡的作者们，原来他们还是奥美的，一起来聊聊水浒卡发行幕后的故事。收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容包括：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 三位幕后高人的分工与介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="161">02:41</a> 都是奥美的！我和水浒卡还有这缘分！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> “香烟卡”的回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">07:25</a> 水浒卡居然只发行了不到一年？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="978">16:18</a> 游戏房中诞生的灵感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1328">22:08</a> 靠卖干脆面盖楼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1885">31:25</a> &nbsp;remake，把过去的遗憾补全</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2732">45:32</a> 只是一个工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2913">48:33</a> 既受益于此，也被限制于此</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3218">53:38</a> 水浒卡独特的时代性与故事性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3733">01:02:13</a> 如果把水浒卡做成文创？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3870">01:04:30</a> 最受欢迎的水浒卡人物</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmAawJ3FYr1rDHzE14xmOpV-LWsT.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>做法诀的公孙胜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk9o1iNX90Oonv4m57l5cvZfZzXu.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>小时候觉得最恐怖的笑面虎</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lo6-WaVM-DdNHTJSFpAf8XtoMbnA.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>最受欢迎的扈三娘和花荣</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgorjJd8pDlauQfjAs_wj15FSjPX.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>雪中的林冲和马上的林冲</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lillarZqGgduBMc1zEikn8Xwv6_n.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>补画的黄信、朱武、呼延灼</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65bb55f6513a776b57dedb32/lnyf_DT-PFWUMDYg6uFG5Fhbl8om.m4a" length="66602944" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:08:34</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FklNm1JUizZbEO2Nva-Annlcr2-o.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>34</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>33.与刘擎在南极聊哲学</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/694cf49c946dca092549666d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">694cf49c946dca092549666d</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 25 Dec 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今年夏天，刘擎老师邀请我一起来南极转转，冬天真来了，感受到了“绝对的”自然，应该没有比南极更适合聊“存在”、谈意义的地方了，抓住这次机会，在归航的船上与刘擎老师录了这期播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容包括：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">01:38</a> 在海上摇晃，跟地球如此强烈地在一起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="476">07:56</a> 在南极看到五星红旗，自豪！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="589">09:49</a> 欺骗岛的风刮起了我对内蒙的回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="648">10:48</a> 人类自大到可以感觉我们很渺小</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="756">12:36</a> 海德格尔vs胡塞尔：关于现象学的师生之争</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1657">27:37</a>在倒酒的瞬间看到馈赠和接纳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 我思故我在</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2830">47:10</a> 用爱情哲学看现代生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3093">51:33</a> 读书与哲学是消遣，是塑造本能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3363">56:03</a> 语言游戏：篮球、酒精和失恋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3553">59:13</a> 与世界“深交”未必是幸福的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4504">01:15:04</a>哲学家就应该多聊天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4870">01:21:10</a> 刘擎：夜晚是思想的故乡</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65bb55f6513a776b57dedb32/llI0L2r-0-OQisNNI1guEnFQBXmQ.m4a" length="84389894" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:26:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FklNm1JUizZbEO2Nva-Annlcr2-o.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>33</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>32.从一条到徐沪生，媒体二十年</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6941631e4c65abaff3514b75</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6941631e4c65abaff3514b75</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 16 Dec 2025 16:00:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>总看到这样的问题：怎么做自媒体、怎么做个人IP。今天的嘉宾、一条的创始人徐沪生用9个月就把自己的账号做到了百万粉丝，从传统纸媒到自媒体创作，他在内容行业创作了近二十年，不少朋友肯定好奇他的内容创作逻辑和理念，今天有幸邀请徐老师来聊一聊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听愉快！&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容包括：</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="112">01:52</a> 娱乐是世界上最稀缺的天分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="252">04:12</a> 十年纸媒，十年短视频，十年个人IP</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="448">07:28</a> 质感不是流量的敌人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 人小而美容易，生意小而美很难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1686">28:06</a> 越想投机、越想求快、越想走捷径，就死得越快</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2037">33:57</a> 说真诚的话，表达真心，总有人爱看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2679">44:39</a> AI让人又感受到了互联网元年的疯狂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3504">58:24</a> 用更丰富的商业来解决拧巴的“反”商业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3845">01:04:05</a> 自媒体就是好好活着，给大家提供价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4379">01:12:59</a> 纯文青“活”不下来？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65bb55f6513a776b57dedb32/ljho0OelaZPG4KBNA71WTP_IJCuE.m4a" length="76997208" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:19:16</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FklNm1JUizZbEO2Nva-Annlcr2-o.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>32</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
